      "text": "Hint P4. Start from the principal in one short interval, \n12000\n𝑡\nΔ\n𝑡\n dollars. That portion has \n1\n−\n𝑡\n years to accrue simple interest. Multiply the portion by its own final-debt factor before adding. For the uniform comparison, replace the borrowing rate while keeping the same time-dependent factor.",
